# Python

- `src/crypto_trader` is the package. Tests live in `tests/` and use `pythonpath = ["src"]`.
- No unofficial Robinhood SDKs. Sign v2 requests with PyNaCl as in the official docs.
- Do not introduce Gemini or other news filters.
- Prefer injecting feeds/brokers in tests over network calls.
